Output "demo.gif"
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 800
Set Height 480
Set Framerate 15
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.5
Set Padding 12

Type "agent-cli run "请分析项目的目录结构" --verbose" Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 12s

Type "agent-cli repl" Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "/stats" Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "/exit" Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
